{
  "__inputs": [
    {
      "name": "DS_LOKI",
      "label": "Loki",
      "description": "The Loki datasource holding halalify-backend logs",
      "type": "datasource",
      "pluginId": "loki",
      "pluginName": "Loki"
    }
  ],
  "__requires": [
    { "type": "grafana", "id": "grafana", "name": "Grafana", "version": "10.0.0" },
    { "type": "datasource", "id": "loki", "name": "Loki", "version": "1.0.0" },
    { "type": "panel", "id": "timeseries", "name": "Time series", "version": "" },
    { "type": "panel", "id": "stat", "name": "Stat", "version": "" },
    { "type": "panel", "id": "bargauge", "name": "Bar gauge", "version": "" },
    { "type": "panel", "id": "text", "name": "Text", "version": "" }
  ],
  "annotations": { "list": [] },
  "description": "Throttling, connection capacity and data-saving failures. Sections 9 and 10 of the Dashboard Metrics Reference.",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "links": [],
  "refresh": "1m",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "tags": ["halalone", "logs", "reliability"],
  "templating": { "list": [] },
  "time": { "from": "now-24h", "to": "now" },
  "timezone": "browser",
  "title": "HalalOne - Reliability and Capacity",
  "uid": "halalone-reliability-capacity",
  "version": 2,
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 100,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "transparent": true,
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Reliability and Capacity\nIs the app turning users away, and is anything failing to save?\n\n**Throttling** happens when someone sends too many messages too quickly, or the shared AI budget runs out. The user gets a 'please wait' message rather than an error.\n\n`user_msg_rate` one person sending messages too fast &nbsp;·&nbsp; `user_llm` one person used up their AI budget &nbsp;·&nbsp; `global_llm` **the whole app hit its AI limit - this affects everyone and matters most**.\n\nAll four boxes below should read 0 in normal use."
      }
    },

    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Users throttled",
      "description": "How many times someone was asked to slow down. Occasional is fine; sustained means limits are too tight or someone is hammering the app.",
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS_LOKI}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 4 },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "background_solid", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "auto", "orientation": "auto", "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short", "decimals": 0, "noValue": "0",
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "orange", "value": 1 }, { "color": "red", "value": 50 }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS_LOKI}" },
          "queryType": "instant",
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({job=\"halalify-backend\"} | json event=\"event\" | event=`ratelimit.rejected` [$__range])) or vector(0)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Turned away (app full)",
      "description": "The app hit its total connection limit and refused someone entirely. This is the serious one - it means real users could not get in.",
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS_LOKI}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 4 },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "background_solid", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "auto", "orientation": "auto", "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short", "decimals": 0, "noValue": "0",
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "red", "value": 1 }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS_LOKI}" },
          "queryType": "instant",
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({job=\"halalify-backend\"} | json event=\"event\" | event=`ws.connection.rejected` [$__range])) or vector(0)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Failed to save",
      "description": "A chat message or session failed to save to the database. Users lose data silently when this happens, so any number here matters.",
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS_LOKI}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 4 },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "background_solid", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "auto", "orientation": "auto", "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short", "decimals": 0, "noValue": "0",
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "red", "value": 1 }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS_LOKI}" },
          "queryType": "instant",
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({job=\"halalify-backend\"} | json event=\"event\" | event=~`.*persist_failed|ws\\.session_context\\.load_failed|compaction\\.failed` [$__range])) or vector(0)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Connections opened",
      "description": "How many times a browser connected to the chat in this window.",
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS_LOKI}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 4 },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["sum"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area", "textMode": "auto", "orientation": "auto", "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "decimals": 0, "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "blue" }, "noValue": "0" }, "overrides": [] },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS_LOKI}" },
          "queryType": "range",
          "legendFormat": "opened",
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({job=\"halalify-backend\"} | json event=\"event\" | event=`ws.connection.opened` [$__interval]))"
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Why users were throttled",
      "description": "global_llm is the one to watch - it means the whole app ran out of AI budget and every user is affected, not just one.",
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS_LOKI}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 9 },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "orientation": "horizontal", "displayMode": "basic", "valueMode": "text",
        "showUnfilled": true, "minVizWidth": 8, "minVizHeight": 18, "namePlacement": "left", "sizing": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "short", "decimals": 0, "min": 0, "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "orange" } },
        "overrides": [
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "global_llm" }, "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "red" } }] }
        ]
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS_LOKI}" },
          "queryType": "instant",
          "legendFormat": "{{kind}}",
          "expr": "sum by (kind) (count_over_time({job=\"halalify-backend\"} | json event=\"event\", kind=\"kind\" | event=`ratelimit.rejected` [$__range]))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Most throttled users",
      "description": "Who is hitting the limits. One user dominating this list is either abusing the service or has a client stuck retrying in a loop.",
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS_LOKI}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 9 },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "orientation": "horizontal", "displayMode": "basic", "valueMode": "text",
        "showUnfilled": true, "minVizWidth": 8, "minVizHeight": 14, "namePlacement": "left", "sizing": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "decimals": 0, "min": 0, "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "orange" } }, "overrides": [] },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS_LOKI}" },
          "queryType": "instant",
          "legendFormat": "{{user_id}}",
          "expr": "topk(10, sum by (user_id) (count_over_time({job=\"halalify-backend\"} | json event=\"event\", user_id=\"user_id\" | event=`ratelimit.rejected` | user_id != `` [$__range])))"
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Connections opening and closing",
      "description": "The two lines should track each other. A persistent gap between them means connections are being held open and not released.",
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS_LOKI}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 17 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short", "min": 0, "decimals": 0,
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 12, "showPoints": "auto", "pointSize": 6, "lineInterpolation": "smooth", "spanNulls": false }
        },
        "overrides": [
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "opened" }, "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "blue" } }] },
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "closed" }, "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "super-light-blue" } }] }
        ]
      },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS_LOKI}" },
          "queryType": "range",
          "legendFormat": "opened",
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({job=\"halalify-backend\"} | json event=\"event\" | event=`ws.connection.opened` [$__interval]))"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS_LOKI}" },
          "queryType": "range",
          "legendFormat": "closed",
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({job=\"halalify-backend\"} | json event=\"event\" | event=`ws.connection.closed` [$__interval]))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Disconnects over time",
      "description": "Users leaving the chat. Normal during use - page reloads and closed tabs all count. A sudden tall spike suggests a network problem or a deploy.",
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS_LOKI}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 17 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short", "min": 0, "decimals": 0,
          "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "yellow" },
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "bars", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 80, "showPoints": "never", "barWidthFactor": 0.8, "barAlignment": 0 }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "hidden", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": false }, "tooltip": { "mode": "single", "sort": "none" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS_LOKI}" },
          "queryType": "range",
          "legendFormat": "disconnects",
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({job=\"halalify-backend\"} | json event=\"event\" | event=`ws.disconnected` [$__interval]))"
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Things that failed to save",
      "description": "Broken down by what failed. These are silent from the user's point of view - they do not see an error, the data just is not there later.",
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS_LOKI}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 25 },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "orientation": "horizontal", "displayMode": "basic", "valueMode": "text",
        "showUnfilled": true, "minVizWidth": 8, "minVizHeight": 18, "namePlacement": "left", "sizing": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "decimals": 0, "min": 0, "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "red" } }, "overrides": [] },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS_LOKI}" },
          "queryType": "instant",
          "legendFormat": "{{event}}",
          "expr": "sum by (event) (count_over_time({job=\"halalify-backend\"} | json event=\"event\" | event=~`.*persist_failed|ws\\.session_context\\.load_failed|compaction\\.failed` [$__range]))"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
